  "rationale": "Independently reviewed both exact source replacements and every unchanged region. The original T guard, stopped collection, same original four-entry table/deletion/full collection and all later insertion-refusal and environment tests remain byte-identical. The first replacement records the original anonymous object key only through a weak-value table and requires true nonnegative integer row/live counts with exactly4 live entries. The second calls the actual read-only Ada storage checker after original collection, requires0 live entries, weak-key-object death and empty public iteration. No C array/hash size or zero-loop result is fabricated. Original0001/0023 stay required for fresh runtime equivalent evidence; no source obligation is excluded.",
  "implementation_review": [
    "Read Verify_Table_Storage: owned heap membership/tag checks precede pointer dereference/hash; array/hash/free links are bounds-checked, finite and consistent; row membership and actual Tables.Find agree. Indexed tombstones and revived free-listed live rows remain legal. Inspection never repairs, allocates, resets failure state or runs collection.",
    "Read the test-only Table_Storage_Probe delegation, actual two-integer adapter publication, collector Clear_Weak before Rebuild/sweep and Tables.Remember_Free/Rebuild. The weak table adds no strong reference to the original collectable key after the loop.",
    "Read22 separately named corruption/liveness/reuse/refusal tests plus3 ordinary public table controls. Source identities and registrations alone grant no passing runtime authority.",
    "Independently inspected76b tail ownership delta: Move_Roots detaches arguments into a selected-owner bridge before source retirement; Dispatch pins it before destructive transition; actual callee is returned explicitly rather than guessed from hook stack. Donation occurs only after callee publication and clearing the bridge logical values, with lifecycle/context/empty-recipient checks. Canonicalbody and all other21 counterpart identities remain unchanged.",
    "Exact source approval only. Final same-image C-original/Ada-derived locals execution, completion/return protocol, actual fault/retry, shutdown and all-context/source/global reconciliation remain mandatory."
